    "seed": 2071,
    "lines": [
      {
        "id": "01",
        "text": "Two hundred and seven star systems lie within twenty-seven light-years of the Sun."
      },
      {
        "id": "02",
        "text": "Every one of them is real."
      },
      {
        "id": "03",
        "text": "I've docked at most of them."
      },
      {
        "id": "04",
        "text": "I started at Earth... with a small courier, and a hold full of medical supplies."
      },
      {
        "id": "05",
        "text": "Four light-years to Alpha Centauri."
      },
      {
        "id": "06",
        "text": "There's a planet at Proxima. That part is true."
      },
      {
        "id": "07",
        "text": "After that, you fly for whoever pays. Freight. Passengers. Bounties."
      },
      {
        "id": "08",
        "text": "You learn who to trust."
      },
      {
        "id": "09",
        "text": "And who's coming for you."
      },
      {
        "id": "10",
        "text": "I built a station at a star most people have never heard of."
      },
      {
        "id": "11",
        "text": "I watched a comet round the Sun."
      },
      {
        "id": "12",
        "text": "And I was there... the night Pyre died."
      },
      {
        "id": "13",
        "text": "The stars are real."
      },
      {
        "id": "14",
        "text": "What you do among them... is up to you."
      }
    ]
  },
